  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb236693f9dbe47498f4dd7ccccbfbf3, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InterviewQuestionData
  question: "Gi\u1EA3i th\xEDch t\u1EEB kh\xF3a 'ref' v\xE0 'out' trong C#. Kh\xE1c
    nhau th\u1EBF n\xE0o?"
  choices:
  - text: "C\u1EA3 hai \u0111\u1EC1u truy\u1EC1n tham s\u1ED1 by reference. 'ref'
      y\xEAu c\u1EA7u bi\u1EBFn ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c kh\u1EDFi t\u1EA1o
      tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi truy\u1EC1n v\xE0o. 'out' kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n kh\u1EDFi t\u1EA1o
      nh\u01B0ng method ph\u1EA3i g\xE1n gi\xE1 tr\u1ECB tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi return."
    score: 3
    feedbackHint: "Ch\xEDnh x\xE1c!"
  - text: "'out' d\xF9ng \u0111\u1EC3 tr\u1EA3 v\u1EC1 nhi\u1EC1u gi\xE1 tr\u1ECB
      t\u1EEB m\u1ED9t h\xE0m, c\xF2n 'ref' d\xF9ng \u0111\u1EC3 thay \u0111\u1ED5i
      gi\xE1 tr\u1ECB b\xEAn ngo\xE0i."
    score: 2
    feedbackHint: "Hi\u1EC3u m\u1EE5c \u0111\xEDch s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng nh\u01B0ng thi\u1EBFu
      chi ti\u1EBFt k\u1EF9 thu\u1EADt."
  - text: "Hai c\xE1i \u0111\xF3 kh\xE1 gi\u1ED1ng nhau, t\xF4i th\u01B0\u1EDDng
      d\xF9ng 'out' \u0111\u1EC3 tr\u1EA3 v\u1EC1 th\xEAm gi\xE1 tr\u1ECB."
    score: 1
    feedbackHint: "C\xF3 v\u1EBB b\u1EA1n ch\u01B0a ph\xE2n bi\u1EC7t \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      s\u1EF1 kh\xE1c nhau quan tr\u1ECDng."
  category: C#
